# Spacing and radius

## Spacing

Use even Tailwind spacing steps only: `2`, `4`, `6`, `8`, `10`, `12`, …

- Prefer for `gap`, `p`/`px`/`py`, `m`/`mx`/`my`/`mt`/`mb`, and positioning offsets
- Do **not** use odd or half steps (`1`, `1.5`, `2.5`, `3`, `5`, …)

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-5">
  <p class="mt-1.5">…</p>
</div>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-4">
  <p class="mt-2">…</p>
</div>
```

## Radius

Default to `rounded-xl` everywhere.

Exceptions only when geometry requires it:

- `rounded-full` — circles / pills (avatars, badges, status dots)
- `rounded-l-none` / `rounded-r-none` — joined control groups

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<section class="rounded-lg p-4">…</section>
<button class="rounded-md px-4 py-2">…</button>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<section class="rounded-xl p-4">…</section>
<button class="rounded-xl px-4 py-2">…</button>
<span class="size-2 rounded-full">…</span>
```
